    <item>
      <title>Comprehensive Overview of 10-Lead ECG Patient Cable with RJ Connector</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cambus-tw/en/product/pro-10-leads-ecg-patient-cable-assembly-with-rj-connector/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cambus-tw/en/product/pro-10-leads-ecg-patient-cable-assembly-with-rj-connector/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Reliable ECG Monitoring Solutions for Home and Clinical Use 
    &lt;div id=&#34;reliable-ecg-monitoring-solutions-for-home-and-clinical-use&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#reliable-ecg-monitoring-solutions-for-home-and-clinical-use&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-92c2792056b21fa35f4a91b0b7c2a793&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;a class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cambus-tw.com/proimages/sr/design/index_pro1.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cambus-tw/index_pro1_13212778812572303544.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;10 Leads ECG Cables&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;10 Leads ECG Cables&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cambus-tw.com/proimages/sr/design/index_pro1.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cambus-tw/index_pro1_14347061732864650998.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;10 Leads ECG Cables&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;10 Leads ECG Cables&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The 10-lead ECG patient cable assembly with RJ45 connector is designed for precise and efficient heart monitoring. Featuring snap-end connectors and available in either IEC or AHA color coding, this cable supports real-time heart readings on compact, handheld devices, making it suitable for both clinical and home environments.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
